#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000014
msgid "What's it gonna take to get through?"
msgstr "要怎样才能打穿它？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000015
msgid "I... I guess an atomic bomb would do it..."
msgstr "我……我想原子弹应该可以……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000016
msgid "You trying to be funny?"
msgstr "你在开玩笑吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000017
msgid ""
"No! I'm telling you, that armor was designed\n"
"to withstand a nuclear war!"
msgstr ""
"不！我告诉你，那装甲是设计来\n"
"抵御核战争的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000018
msgid ""
"We can't get through to the President.\n"
"The decision is on us."
msgstr ""
"联系不上总统。\n"
"只能我们自己决定了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000019
msgid "You can't be serious!"
msgstr "你认真的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001a
msgid ""
"There's no way I'm gonna \n"
"wipe out the human race."
msgstr ""
"我绝不可能\n"
"毁灭人类。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001b
msgid "This is the President's call!"
msgstr "这该由总统决定！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001c
msgid ""
"There's no time for that. \n"
"We need a decision, now."
msgstr ""
"没时间了。\n"
"必须马上决定。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001d
msgid ""
"Huey, get the Pentagon on the line!\n"
"We have to tell them the nukes aren't real!"
msgstr ""
"休伊，接通五角大楼！\n"
"得告诉他们核弹是假的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001e
msgid "I'll give it a shot."
msgstr "我试试。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001f
msgid "Forget the order of succession. "
msgstr "别管继任顺序了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000020
msgid ""
"If we're all going to hell, \n"
"let's take those bastards with us!"
msgstr ""
"既然都要下地狱，\n"
"就拉那些混蛋一起陪葬！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000021
msgid "We have twelve minutes to impact, sir."
msgstr "距撞击十二分钟，长官。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000022
msgid "...May God have mercy on our souls."
msgstr "……愿上帝怜悯我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000023
msgid "Jesus... Coldman guessed wrong!"
msgstr "天哪……科尔德曼猜错了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000024
msgid "They're gonna go through with it!"
msgstr "他们真要动手了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000025
msgid "The platform's sustained a lot of external damage. All we need is some pressure... "
msgstr "平台外部损伤严重。只差一点压力……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000026
msgid "Pressure?"
msgstr "压力？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000027
msgid ""
"Sink it in the lake. \n"
"With that much water pressure, "
msgstr ""
"把它沉进湖里。\n"
"那么大的水压，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000028
msgid ""
"even the tiniest crack should be \n"
"enough to flood the innards."
msgstr ""
"哪怕最细小的裂缝\n"
"也足以让内部进水。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000029
msgid ""
"The AI pod is a mass of \n"
"highly sensitive electronics. "
msgstr ""
"AI 舱体是大量\n"
"高精密电子元件。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002a
msgid "Short the contacts and the signal will stop."
msgstr "让触点短路，信号就会停止。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002b
msgid "How much does that thing weigh?"
msgstr "那东西有多重？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002c
msgid "500 tons."
msgstr "500 吨。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002d
msgid "It's hopeless. We can't move that thing."
msgstr "没戏了。搬不动那东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002e
msgid "Get the Pentagon on the phone!"
msgstr "接五角大楼！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002f
msgid "Incoming MIRV warheads have separated."
msgstr "来袭分导弹头已分离。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000030
msgid "Estimated time to impact now eleven minutes."
msgstr "预计撞击时间还有十一分钟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000031
msgid "Sir, we've got a call!"
msgstr "长官，有电话！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000032
msgid "The President?!"
msgstr "总统？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000033
msgid "No, sir."
msgstr "不，长官。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000034
msgid "Then who?"
msgstr "那是谁？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000035
msgid "He, um..."
msgstr "他，呃……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000036
msgid "Spit it out!"
msgstr "快说！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000037
msgid "He claims to be... Big Boss."
msgstr "他自称是…BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000038
msgid "Big Boss? Patch him through!"
msgstr "BIG BOSS？接进来！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000039
msgid "Mr. Chairman, I'll get straight to the point."
msgstr "主席先生，我就直说了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003a
msgid "Cancel the retaliatory strike, now!"
msgstr "取消报复性打击，立刻！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003c
msgid ""
"The radar blips you're seeing are all fakes.\n"
"No one's launched any nukes."
msgstr ""
"你看到的雷达光点全是假的。\n"
"没人发射任何核弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003d
msgid "How do you know?"
msgstr "你咋知道？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003e
msgid ""
"The launch data is fake, \n"
"part of an experiment that leaked. "
msgstr ""
"发射数据是假的，\n"
"是一次实验泄露出来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003f
msgid ""
"You weren't supposed to receive it.\n"
"Your radar is showing missiles that don't exist."
msgstr ""
"本不该传到你们那里。\n"
"你们雷达上的导弹根本不存在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000040
msgid ""
"If you're lying, then we've got \n"
"10 minutes 'til we're toast. "
msgstr ""
"你要是撒谎，我们\n"
"十分钟后就完蛋了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000041
msgid "We have to retaliate or more Americans die."
msgstr "我们必须报复，否则会有更多美国人丧命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000042
msgid "The experiment was planned and executed "
msgstr "那次实验的策划与执行者"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000043
msgid "by the CIA's station chief in Central America."
msgstr "是CIA驻中美洲情报站站长。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000044
msgid "Then put him on!"
msgstr "那就让他接电话！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000045
msgid "He's dead. I can give you his name, though."
msgstr "他死了。名字可以给你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000046
msgid ""
"We need more than the authentication code\n"
"you gave the switchboard."
msgstr ""
"我们需要的不只是你给总机的那串验证码\n"
"。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000047
msgid ""
" We need proof you're actually Big Boss.\n"
"Do you have any?"
msgstr ""
"我们需要证据证明你真是BIG BOSS。\n"
"你有吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000048
msgid "Alright... If you know the name Big Boss..."
msgstr "好吧……如果你知道BIG BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000049
msgid "Then maybe you were there... at the ceremony... "
msgstr "那你也许当时在场……在典礼上……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004a
msgid "when I received the title from President Johnson."
msgstr "我从约翰逊总统接过称号时。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004b
msgid "Indeed I was..."
msgstr "我确实在场……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004c
msgid "We don't have time for this bullshit!"
msgstr "我们没时间听这些废话！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004d
msgid "Hold it! Let's hear him out. You were saying?"
msgstr "等等！让他说完。你刚才说？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004e
msgid ""
"At the ceremony, the DCI tried to shake my hand.\n"
"I refused."
msgstr ""
"典礼上，DCI想跟我握手。\n"
"我拒绝了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004f
msgid ""
"What happened in that room is \n"
"classified - top secret."
msgstr ""
"那间屋子里发生的事是\n"
"最高机密。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000050
msgid "Only a handful of people would know."
msgstr "只有少数几个人会知道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000051
msgid "He's making it up! Don't listen to him!"
msgstr "他在编故事！别听他的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000052
msgid "Wait! Why did you refuse to shake his hand?"
msgstr "等等！你为什么拒绝跟他握手？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000053
msgid "Because I knew where my loyalty belonged."
msgstr "因为我知道我的忠诚属于谁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000054
msgid ""
"Everybody, listen to me!\n"
"Those Soviet missiles are fakes!"
msgstr ""
"各位，听我说！\n"
"那些苏联导弹是假的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000055
msgid "What?! You're actually going to believe him?"
msgstr "什么？！你真要信他？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000056
msgid "He's right! This is some sort of Commie trick!"
msgstr "他说得对！这是共产党的诡计！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000057
msgid "No, it's the real Big Boss. Trust me."
msgstr "不，他是真正的BIG BOSS。相信我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000058
msgid "How can you know for sure?!"
msgstr "你怎么能确定？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000059
msgid "Because I was the Army Chief of Staff back then, "
msgstr "因为当时我是陆军参谋长，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005a
msgid ""
"and I was standing right next to the DCI\n"
"when it happened. I saw everything."
msgstr ""
"事发时我就站在DCI旁边。\n"
"我全看见了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005b
msgid ""
"You saved us all, Big Boss.\n"
"We'll stand down the alert."
msgstr ""
"你救了我们，BIG BOSS。\n"
"我们解除警报。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005d
msgid "When we meet again, I hope you'll shake my hand. "
msgstr "下次见面时，希望你能跟我握手。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005e
msgid "What are you doing?!"
msgstr "你干嘛？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005f
msgid "Sorry, Chairman. But we are not standing down!"
msgstr "抱歉，主席。但我们不解除警报！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000060
msgid "Dammit...!"
msgstr "该死！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000061
msgid "Those worthless sacks of..."
msgstr "那些没用的废物……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000062
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr "等等……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000065
msgid "It's opening...?"
msgstr "它开了…？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000066
msgid "She's calling to you..."
msgstr "她在呼唤你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000067
msgid ""
"Destroy the Mammal Pod \n"
"and the data will stop flowing!"
msgstr ""
"摧毁哺乳舱\n"
"数据就会停止传输！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000068
msgid "Please, stop her..."
msgstr "求你，拦她…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000000
msgid "Valid data regions: Zero."
msgstr "有效数据区域：ZERO。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000001
msgid "Exit all done."
msgstr "退出完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000002
msgid "...It stopped."
msgstr "…停了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000003
msgid "The data uplink's bypassing the Mammal Pod...?"
msgstr "数据上行绕过了哺乳舱……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000004
msgid "Put down the gun!"
msgstr "把枪放下！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000005
msgid "Come to your senses, man! "
msgstr "清醒点，老兄！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000006
msgid ""
"The fate of the world... \n"
"the fate of Earth is at stake here!"
msgstr ""
"世界的命运……\n"
"地球的命运在此一举！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000000
msgid "Why?!"
msgstr "为什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000001
msgid "I don't understand!!"
msgstr "我不明白！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000002
msgid "Answer me!!"
msgstr "回答我！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000003
msgid "Tell me why!!"
msgstr "说啊！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000004
msgid "ANSWER ME!!!"
msgstr "回答我！！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000005
msgid "BO-O-O-OSS!!!!"
msgstr "头——儿——！！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000000
msgid "Six minutes remaining."
msgstr "剩余六分钟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000001
msgid ""
"...Wait. Authority rests with me now.\n"
"I'm ordering a retaliation."
msgstr ""
"……等等。现在指挥权在我手上。\n"
"我下令反击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000002
msgid "No, don't! It's the end of us all!"
msgstr "不，别！会害死大家！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000003
msgid ""
"Who gives a damn?!\n"
"I'm not gonna sit here and die like a dog!"
msgstr ""
"谁管？！\n"
"我才不坐这等死！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000004
msgid "If the Russians are gonna kill my family "
msgstr "如果俄国人要杀我家人"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000005
msgid "and destroy my country, I'm taking them with me!"
msgstr "毁我国家，我就拉他们一起陪葬！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000006
msgid ""
"You see now, Chairman?\n"
"Deterrence is just a fool's dream."
msgstr ""
"看到了吧，议长？\n"
"威慑是蠢人梦。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000007
msgid "Why?! Why won't it stop?!"
msgstr "为什么？！为什么停不下来？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000008
msgid ""
"Sometimes the body continues to live\n"
"even after the brain is damaged."
msgstr ""
"有时大脑受损后\n"
"身体仍会继续存活。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000009
msgid "The Boss AI isn't doing this. "
msgstr "这不是THE BOSS AI干的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000a
msgid "I think it's something rather more primitive..."
msgstr "我觉得是更原始的东西……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000b
msgid "Reptile has taken up Mammal's dying wish... "
msgstr "爬虫类继承了哺乳类的遗愿……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000c
msgid "No... "
msgstr "不……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000e
msgid "Don't just sit there! STOP IT!"
msgstr "别光坐着！快阻止它！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000001
msgid "That voice..."
msgstr "那声音…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002e
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000073
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "什么……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000003
msgid "...What's going on?"
msgstr "…怎么回事？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000004
msgid "That song..."
msgstr "那首歌……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000005
msgid "Boss... is that you...?"
msgstr "BOSS…是你吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000006
msgid "How in the...?"
msgstr "怎么会？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000007
msgid "A ghost in the machine...?"
msgstr "机器里的幽灵？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000008
msgid "She's drowning herself to stop the transmission?"
msgstr "她是在自我淹没以停止传输？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000009
msgid "Look!"
msgstr "看！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000a
msgid "It's functional compensation. "
msgstr "这是功能代偿。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000b
msgid ""
"When the human brain is damaged,\n"
"sometimes it recovers over time."
msgstr ""
"人脑受损后，\n"
"有时会随着时间恢复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Other parts of the brain take over the functions\n"
"of the damaged parts."
msgstr ""
"大脑其他部分会接管\n"
"受损部分的功能。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000d
msgid ""
"Mammal and Reptile were patterned after\n"
"different parts of the human brain."
msgstr ""
"哺乳类和爬虫类分别仿照\n"
"人脑的不同部分。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000e
msgid ""
"When those parts were assembled \n"
"together into one, "
msgstr ""
"当这些部分被组装\n"
"到一起时，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000f
msgid ""
"they must've become capable \n"
"of functional compensation..."
msgstr ""
"它们一定变得能够\n"
"进行功能代偿……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000010
msgid "Her memories remained with her..."
msgstr "她的记忆留了下来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000011
msgid "Is this her answer?"
msgstr "这是她答案？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000012
msgid "This song?"
msgstr "这歌？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000013
msgid ""
"It's clearly not thinking rationally...\n"
"It's not using its head... "
msgstr ""
"它显然不是在理性思考……\n"
"它没有用脑子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000014
msgid "It's using... its heart."
msgstr "它在用……心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000015
msgid "This is the fate she chose for herself."
msgstr "这是她为自己选择的命运。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000016
msgid "The Boss' innocence has been proven..."
msgstr "THE BOSS的清白得到了证明……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000017
msgid ""
"Do you hear it, Snake? \n"
"Do you hear The Boss' song?"
msgstr ""
"你听到了吗，SNAKE？\n"
"你听到THE BOSS的歌了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000018
msgid "You saw it, didn't you?"
msgstr "你看到了，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000019
msgid "When you went to space..."
msgstr "你去太空时……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001a
msgid "That there's beauty outside of battle."
msgstr "战斗之外也有美。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001b
msgid "At last I understand. In the end..."
msgstr "我终于明白了。到头来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001c
msgid "It was you who put down your gun..."
msgstr "是你放下了枪……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001d
msgid "And chose instead to sing..."
msgstr "转而选择了歌唱……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001e
msgid "They can all hear you... I know they can..."
msgstr "他们都听得到……我知道……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001f
msgid "And your will shall surely live on."
msgstr "你的意志必将延续。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000020
msgid ""
"That's what you wanted... so much that \n"
"you gave up everything you had..."
msgstr ""
"那是你想要的……你甚至为此\n"
"舍弃了你拥有的一切……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000021
msgid "But you couldn't achieve it."
msgstr "但你没能实现它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000022
msgid "Isn't that right? And still all you can do is sing."
msgstr "不是吗？而你所能做的依然只是歌唱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000023
msgid "There's no peace to be found, anywhere."
msgstr "哪里都找不到和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000024
msgid "And so we can only keep on hoping..."
msgstr "所以我们只能继续期盼……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000025
msgid "Hoping for the illusion we call peace."
msgstr "期盼那名为和平的幻象。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000000
msgid ""
"Once upon a time, there were two young men\n"
"who idolized a hero called The Boss. "
msgstr ""
"从前，有两个年轻人\n"
"崇拜着一位名叫THE BOSS的英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000001
msgid ""
"One day, they suddenly lost \n"
"the point of origin - the cipher -"
msgstr ""
"有一天，他们突然失去了\n"
"原点，那密码，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000002
msgid ""
"that was like a mother to them.\n"
"Unable to come to terms with their sorrow,"
msgstr ""
"对他们而言如同母亲一般。\n"
"无法接受这份悲伤，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000003
msgid ""
"they each decided to carry \n"
"on the will of their hero."
msgstr ""
"他们各自决定\n"
"继承英雄的意志。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000004
msgid "But they could not agree on what that meant."
msgstr "但他们对含义无法达成一致。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000005
msgid ""
"In the end, they became bitter enemies,\n"
"and the zero from which they both started"
msgstr ""
"最终，他们成了死敌，\n"
"而他们共同出发的那个零"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000006
msgid "was split into two."
msgstr "被一分为二。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000007
msgid ""
"...And you have been on the wrong \n"
"path ever since."
msgstr ""
"...而你从此走上了错误的\n"
"道路。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000008
msgid ""
"There's no \"happily ever after\" \n"
"waiting for you in the end. Unless... "
msgstr ""
"最终等待你的，不会是\n"
"\"幸福结局\"。除非..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000009
msgid "You obey the will of Cipher!"
msgstr "你服从Cipher的意志！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000a
msgid "Where does an army without borders call home? "
msgstr "一支没有国界的军队，家在何方？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000b
msgid ""
"A state without borders, of course...\n"
"a world without borders. "
msgstr ""
"无国界的国家，当然...\n"
"无国界的世界。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000c
msgid "A world without borders..?"
msgstr "无国界的世界..？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000d
msgid "The Cold War order is about to collapse. "
msgstr "冷战秩序即将崩溃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000e
msgid ""
"The age of electronic intelligence is \n"
"about to begin. "
msgstr ""
"电子情报的时代\n"
"即将开始。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000f
msgid "The NSA (National Security Agency),"
msgstr "NSA（国家安全局），"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000010
msgid "CSS (Central Security Service),"
msgstr "CSS（中央安全局），"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000011
msgid "NRO (National Reconnaissance Office),"
msgstr "NRO（国家侦察局），"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000012
msgid ""
"DIA (Defense Intelligence Agency), \n"
"et cetera, et cetera..."
msgstr ""
"DIA（国防情报局），\n"
"等等，等等..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000013
msgid ""
"The intelligence community \n"
"that has long bickered amongst itself "
msgstr ""
"长期以来内斗不休的\n"
"情报界"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000014
msgid "will be united in a world governed by electrons."
msgstr "将在电子主宰的世界中团结一致。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000015
msgid "Cipher will gather all information,"
msgstr "Cipher将收集所有情报，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000016
msgid ""
"watching over the world \n"
"and guiding the will of its people,"
msgstr ""
"监视世界\n"
"并引导民众的意志，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000017
msgid "all while they remain blissfully unaware."
msgstr "而他们始终浑然不觉。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000018
msgid "There will be no one to oppose them! "
msgstr "将无人能与之抗衡！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000019
msgid ""
"For the first time, \n"
"the world will be ruled by a single will!"
msgstr ""
"世界将首次\n"
"被单一意志所统治！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001a
msgid "Until the new order is in place,"
msgstr "在新秩序建立之前，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001b
msgid ""
"you and your army will be \n"
"the force that protects it."
msgstr ""
"你和你的军队将是\n"
"守护它的力量。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001c
msgid "You will be Cipher's deterrent,"
msgstr "你将成为Cipher的威慑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001d
msgid "pulling the wool over the eyes of the old order"
msgstr "以你的魅力和军事才能"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001e
msgid "with your charisma and military prowess."
msgstr "蒙蔽旧秩序的双眼。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001f
msgid ""
"Accept our offer, and we wil allow you \n"
"to retain control of MSF and ZEKE."
msgstr ""
"接受我们的提议，我们就允许你\n"
"继续掌控MSF和ZEKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000020
msgid "That's... an offer?"
msgstr "这……也算提议？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000021
msgid ""
"The Boss threw down her gun, \n"
"and with it her life's calling."
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS扔下枪，\n"
"也扔下一生使命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000022
msgid ""
"You - her disciple - have never been \n"
"able to do that. You are too afraid to let go."
msgstr ""
"你——她的弟子——从来都\n"
"做不到。你太害怕放手。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000023
msgid "I was made to fight. I am a gun."
msgstr "我生来就是为了战斗。我是一把枪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000024
msgid ""
"Is that so?! Then what do you call this?\n"
"Is it a gun, too?"
msgstr ""
"是吗？！那你管这叫什么？\n"
"它也是枪吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000025
msgid ""
"You are a lousy liar! Admit it - this thing is \n"
"a monstrosity, a product of your own fear!"
msgstr ""
"你撒谎真差！承认吧，这东西\n"
"是怪物，是你恐惧的产物！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000026
msgid ""
"But not Cipher! \n"
"Cipher thought of something different. "
msgstr ""
"但Cipher不一样！\n"
"Cipher想出了不同的办法。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000027
msgid "Cipher's going to control guns."
msgstr "Cipher要控制枪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000028
msgid "Control guns?"
msgstr "控制枪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000029
msgid "That is right. Not deter, control. It is the ultimate approach to the illusion of peace..."
msgstr "没错。不是威慑，是控制。这是通往和平幻象的终极手段……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002a
msgid "Control power? You're gonna be disappointed."
msgstr "控制力量？你会失望的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002b
msgid "Then we are done! Thank you for playing! "
msgstr "那就到此为止！感谢游玩！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002c
msgid ""
"Better luck next time. The offer is rescinded! \n"
"And now, the ultimatum."
msgstr ""
"下次好运。提议作废！\n"
"现在，是最后通牒。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002d
msgid "ZEKE is already in nuclear strike mode."
msgstr "ZEKE已进入核打击模式。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002f
msgid ""
"I'm taking the weapon you built and using it\n"
"to launch a nuclear strike"
msgstr ""
"我要用你造的武器\n"
"发动核打击"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000030
msgid "on the east coast of the United States!"
msgstr "目标是美国东海岸！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000031
msgid "You're insane! What are you after?!"
msgstr "你疯了！你到底想要什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000032
msgid "But wait, here is your consolation prize:"
msgstr "不过等等，这是你的安慰奖："

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000033
msgid ""
"We are about to show the world just \n"
"how dangerous a gang of outlaws"
msgstr ""
"我们即将向世界展示\n"
"一群亡命之徒"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000034
msgid " - an army without borders - can be!"
msgstr "——一支无国界的军队——能有多危险！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000035
msgid ""
"You and your men will become pariahs,\n"
"and you will be wiped off the face of the earth."
msgstr ""
"你和你的手下将成为贱民，\n"
"被从地球上抹去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000036
msgid ""
"Rather than heroes, you will be seen \n"
"as a well-armed, extremist cult"
msgstr ""
"你们不会被当英雄，\n"
"而是武装精良的极端教派"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000037
msgid ""
"prone to indiscriminate outbursts \n"
"of nuclear aggression."
msgstr ""
"动辄发动不分青红皂白的\n"
"核侵略。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000038
msgid "You will give rise to a new world order, "
msgstr "你们将催生新世界秩序，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000039
msgid ""
"an age of deterrence defined by its fear of\n"
"extremist cult influence."
msgstr ""
"一个恐惧极端教派影响力的\n"
"威慑时代。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003a
msgid "Do you like the picture I am painting, Big Boss?!"
msgstr "喜欢我画的这幅图吗，BIG BOSS？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003b
msgid ""
"When all is said and done, \n"
"peace is nothing but a fantasy! "
msgstr ""
"说到底，\n"
"和平不过是幻想！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003c
msgid "A game's a game! You either win or you lose!"
msgstr "游戏就是游戏！不是赢就是输！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003d
msgid "All you can do is fight!"
msgstr "你只能战斗！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003e
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x3564e1/0x000000
msgid "Stop me if you can!"
msgstr "有本事就来阻止我！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003f
msgid "The peace sign is the \"V\" of victory!"
msgstr "和平手势就是胜利的\"V\"！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000040
msgid "Say PEACE!"
msgstr "说\"和平\"！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000000
msgid "It is no use, ZEKE is out of my control. "
msgstr "没用，ZEKE不受我控了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000001
msgid "This is where it ends."
msgstr "到此为止了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000002
msgid "Listen to me, Big Boss... "
msgstr "听我说，BIG BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000003
msgid ""
"As long as your army is needed,\n"
"the world will never know true peace."
msgstr ""
"只要还需要你的军队，\n"
"世界就永无真正和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000004
msgid ""
"The peace you will know will be fleeting - illusory.\n"
"They will use you, disgrace you, "
msgstr ""
"你所知的和平转瞬即逝——虚幻不实。\n"
"他们会利用你，羞辱你，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000005
msgid ""
"and then, finally, discard you \n"
"like they would a cancer to society."
msgstr ""
"最后，像丢弃社会的毒瘤一样\n"
"将你抛弃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000006
msgid "This is the path you have chosen!"
msgstr "这就是你选择的道路！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000007
msgid "Paz..."
msgstr "帕兹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000000
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr "怎么样？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000001
msgid "How's ZEKE look?"
msgstr "ZEKE怎样？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000002
msgid ""
"The attitude control AI had a backup,\n"
"so... it should be able to walk."
msgstr ""
"姿态控制AI有备份，\n"
"所以……应该能走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000003
msgid "Really... That's good."
msgstr "是吗……那太好了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000004
msgid "Beyond that, it's up to the creator..."
msgstr "此外就看创造者了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000005
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "站住！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000006
msgid "Don't come any closer, doctor."
msgstr "别再靠近了，博士。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000007
msgid "There's something I've been meaning to ask you..."
msgstr "有件事我一直想问你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000008
msgid "Do you..."
msgstr "你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000009
msgid "do you despise me?"
msgstr "你讨厌我吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000a
msgid "Doctor, are you asking me out?"
msgstr "医生，你是在约我吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000b
msgid "No no, not at all..."
msgstr "不不，完全不是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000c
msgid "No?"
msgstr "不是吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000d
msgid "Pity..."
msgstr "真遗憾……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Because I've just had \n"
"my heart broken by someone else."
msgstr ""
"因为我刚被别人\n"
"伤了心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000010
msgid "I only like those who can stand on their own."
msgstr "我只喜欢能独立自主的人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000011
msgid "If you fancy me, then come walk with me."
msgstr "要是你中意我，就跟我来吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000012
msgid "Who knows what miracles might happen?"
msgstr "谁知道会发生什么奇迹呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000013
msgid "Love is blind, after all."
msgstr "毕竟爱情盲目。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000014
msgid "Take your time... "
msgstr "慢慢来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000015
msgid "I'll be waiting..."
msgstr "我会等你的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000000
msgid "Meow! Don't point that funky weapon at me-ow!"
msgstr "喵！别拿那怪武器指着我喵！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000001
msgid "A talking cat...?"
msgstr "会说话的猫……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000002
msgid ""
"Hey, you wouldn't happen to be a hunter, \n"
"would you?"
msgstr ""
"嘿，你该不会正好是个猎人吧，\n"
"对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000003
msgid "Me, I'm Trenya. Purr-eased to meet you."
msgstr "我叫Trenya，幸会喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000004
msgid "Trenya?"
msgstr "Trenya？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000005
msgid "That's what I said. If you're a hunter,"
msgstr "没错。如果你是猎人，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000006
msgid ""
"I can take you to an island \n"
"where there're lots of rare creatures."
msgstr ""
"我能带你去一座\n"
"有很多稀有生物的岛。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000007
msgid "I bet you'd get a kick out of hunting them, meow."
msgstr "我打赌你一定会猎得很过瘾，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000008
msgid "Creatures...? Even rarer than a talking cat?"
msgstr "生物？比会说话的猫还稀有？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000009
msgid ""
"Nothing gets by you...\n"
"But, no! There're even bigger ones on the island. "
msgstr ""
"瞒不过你……\n"
"不过不对！岛上还有更大的家伙。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000a
msgid "Huge monsters, meow!"
msgstr "大怪物，喵！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000b
msgid "Monsters?!"
msgstr "怪物？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000c
msgid "A hunter like you can't possibly pass this up!"
msgstr "你这样的猎人绝不会错过！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000d
msgid "Sorry, kitty, but I'm no hunter."
msgstr "抱歉，小猫，我不是猎人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000e
msgid "Whaa?! Oh, man... "
msgstr "啥？！天哪……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000f
msgid ""
"I saw that killer look in your eye and thought \n"
"you were special somehow, meow."
msgstr ""
"我看到你眼中的杀意，还以为 \n"
"你有多特别呢，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000010
msgid "...Not exactly ordinary yourself."
msgstr "……你也不普通。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000000
msgid ""
"Sigh... Over hill and over dale, \n"
"through rain and snow"
msgstr ""
"唉……翻山越岭，\n"
"风雨无阻"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000001
msgid ""
"I come all the way out here \n"
"from Pokke Farm to find work,"
msgstr ""
"我从波凯农场大老远跑来\n"
"找活干，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000002
msgid "and not a single customer so far... "
msgstr "结果到现在一个客人也没有……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000003
msgid "Not to be rude, but I've got things to do."
msgstr "不是失礼，但我还有事忙。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000004
msgid ""
"So if you need someone to go monster hunting\n"
"with you, find someone else."
msgstr ""
"所以你要是想找人陪你猎怪，\n"
"另请高明吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000005
msgid "Wait! At least listen to my sales pitch, meow!"
msgstr "等等！至少听听我的推销嘛，喵！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000006
msgid "...Fine..."
msgstr "……好吧……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000000
msgid "On that island, there are undiscovered monsters that drop amazing stuff when you beat 'em."
msgstr "那座岛上有没被发现的怪物，打倒它们能掉超棒的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000001
msgid "Stuff that's sure to be purr-ty handy... "
msgstr "那些东西肯定超好用……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000002
msgid "If you decide you want to have a look for yourself, select \"Hunting Quest\" from the Mission Select screen, meow."
msgstr "如果你决定想亲自去看看，在任务选择画面选“狩猎任务”，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000003
msgid "I'll come and ferry you over."
msgstr "我会来接你过去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000000
msgid "Sounds purrrfect!"
msgstr "太完美了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now you're speaking my language, meow!\n"
"You and me are gonna get along great. "
msgstr ""
"这才对嘛，喵！\n"
"咱俩肯定合得来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000002
msgid ""
" So, anytime you want to go on a Hunting Quest,\n"
"just give me a holler."
msgstr ""
"所以，你想去狩猎任务的时候，\n"
"喊我一声就行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000003
msgid "Ta ta for meow!"
msgstr "喵喵再见！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b092d/0x32adf2/0x000000
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting, meow."
msgstr "抱歉让你久等了，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b092d/0x32adf2/0x000001
msgid "It's about time. Let's go, Trenya! "
msgstr "时候到了。走吧，Trenya！"

