#: slot/0x00420130/0x6297fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Look alive, ladies! \n"
"The Boss is gonna join us! "
msgstr ""
"打起精神，姑娘们！\n"
"BOSS要来了！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62987d/0x000000
msgid "Show 'em how it's done, Boss."
msgstr "让她们见识下，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6298fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your first priority in enemy \n"
"territory is knowing your surroundings."
msgstr ""
"在敌区首要之事\n"
"是掌握周围环境。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6298fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Your life depends on where you are looking\n"
"and how fast you can identify your target."
msgstr ""
"你的命取决于你看向哪里\n"
"以及多快锁定目标。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6298fd/0x000002
msgid ""
"Therefore, you must first \n"
"master moving your line of sight."
msgstr ""
"因此，你必须先\n"
"掌握移动视线。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62997d/0x000000
msgid ""
"To move your line of sight, \n"
"use the Camera Buttons."
msgstr ""
"移动视线，\n"
"使用镜头键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62997d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now, when I give you an order, \n"
"look in that direction."
msgstr ""
"我下令时，\n"
"就朝那个方向看。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6299fd/0x000000
msgid "Look up!"
msgstr "往上看！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629a7d/0x000000
msgid "Look down!"
msgstr "往下看！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629afd/0x000000
