msgstr "往右看！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629bfd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x629c7d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001ae
#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000007
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "怎么了？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629bfd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Use the up and down Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr ""
"用上下镜头键\n"
"移动视线！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629c7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Use the right and left Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr ""
"用左右镜头键\n"
"移动视线！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a7fd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a87d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6458fe/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6468fd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6468fe/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x64ab7e/0x000000
msgid "Boss, "
msgstr "BOSS，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a7fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"use the up and down Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight.  "
msgstr ""
"用上下镜头键\n"
"移动视线。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"use the left and right Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight.  "
msgstr ""
"用左右镜头键\n"
"移动视线。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a8fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"You should be familiar with the up \n"
"and down Camera Buttons now."
msgstr ""
"你现在应该熟悉\n"
"上下镜头键了。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a8fd/0x000001
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a97d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Action Button \n"
"if you're ready to move on."
msgstr ""
"准备好了就按动作键\n"
"继续。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a97d/0x000000
msgid ""
"You should be familiar with \n"
"the left and right Camera Buttons now."
msgstr ""
"你现在应该熟悉\n"
"左右镜头键了。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b7fd/0x000000
msgid "Next we'll check your left and right."
msgstr "接下来测试你的左右操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b87d/0x000000
msgid "Now we'll check your up and down."
msgstr "测上下操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b8fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, we'll go over up and down with\n"
"the Camera Buttons one more time. "
msgstr ""
"好，我们再用\n"
"镜头键过一遍上下操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b97d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, we'll go over left and right with\n"
"the Camera Buttons one more time. "
msgstr ""
"好，我们再用\n"
"镜头键过一遍左右操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b9fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"You can change the controls anytime \n"
"in Options. "
msgstr ""
"你可以随时在\n"
"设置里更改操作方式。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62ba7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Go with the method that works \n"
"best for you."
msgstr ""
"选最适合你的\n"
"方式就行。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bafd/0x000000
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "明白。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000000
msgid "Next I'll explain how to change stances."
msgstr "接下来说明如何切换姿势。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"If you just stand there \n"
"like an idiot in front of an enemy, "
msgstr ""
"要是你像个傻瓜一样\n"
"站在敌人面前，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000002
msgid "you might as well kill yourself now. "
msgstr "那还不如现在就自杀。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000003
msgid ""
"At times you will need to \n"
"get low to avoid detection. "
msgstr ""
"有时你需要\n"
"压低身位来躲避侦查。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000004
msgid ""
"You have three stances: \n"
"stand, crouch, and lying down."
msgstr ""
"共有三种姿势：\n"
"站、蹲、卧。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000005
msgid ""
"To change stances use \n"
"the Crouch Button. "
msgstr ""
"用\n"
"蹲伏键切换姿势。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000006
msgid ""
"Tap the Crouch Button to change \n"
"between standing and crouching."
msgstr ""
"轻按蹲伏键切换\n"
"站立与蹲伏。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000007
msgid "You can move in either stance."
msgstr "两种姿势都能移动。"
